flowchart TD
    CHANGE[change] --> SRC{trigger}
    SRC -->|local write| CASCADE[evict entry + dependents]
    SRC -->|server push/version| CASCADE
    SRC -->|TTL| ENTRY[evict entry]
    SRC -->|release| ALL{cache version changed?}
    ALL -->|yes| WIPE[invalidate all old-shaped]
    CASCADE --> LAYERS[all layers coherent]
    ENTRY --> LAYERS
    LAYERS --> NEXT[next read refetch/SWR]
